OL,7, ]D                                   R
OL,8, ]DADWrite to your MP and say you use
OL,9, ]D   ORACLE and value having a choice
OL,10, ]D   in teletext services.
OL,11, ]D
OL,12, ]DADORACLE offers more variety than
OL,13, ]D   Ceefax which only offers a basic
OL,14, ]D   information service.
OL,15, ]D
OL,16, ]DADBroadcasting minister, David
OL,17, ]D   Mellor says he welcomes comments
OL,18, ]D   so let him have yours!
OL,19, ]                                    R
